<title>USA: SITEL names chief executive.</title>
<headline>SITEL names chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SITEL Corp said Friday its president, Michael May, has been named chief executive officer.</p>
<p>James Lynch, SITEL founder, and previously chairman and CEO, remains chairman, telephone-based customer service outsourcer SITEL said.</p>
<p>Phillip Clough, a principal with the investment banking firm of Alex. Brown &amp; Sons, was named to succeed May as president, SITEL said.</p>
<p>SITEL shares were down 1/8 at 17-3/4 Friday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
